% --- Section IV: Evaluation ---
\section{Performance Evaluation}
\label{sec:evaluation}

\subsection{Experimental Setup}
We trained the agent using a simulator with real-world network traces (FCC and HSDPA) and tested on a diverse set of videos: \textit{BigBuckBunny, CrowdRun, Sintel, TearsOfSteel}. We compare against:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Pensieve:} State-of-the-art RL.
    \item \textbf{RobustMPC:} Model Predictive Control.
    \item \textbf{BBA:} Buffer-Based Approach.
    \item \textbf{Genie:} An offline optimal upper bound (theoretical maximum).
\end{itemize}

