% --- Section V: Conclusion ---
\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusion}
We presented a Future-Aware PPO agent for adaptive video streaming. By incorporating immediate future chunk sizes into the state space, our agent learns a robust policy that balances visual quality and playback stability. Experimental results demonstrate that our method outperforms standard RL baselines in QoE by 2.1\% while offering a 3x reduction in switching frequency compared to control-theoretic approaches. This work highlights the importance of "short-term foresight" in reinforcement learning for systems control.

